Keep incremental sections live when writing a recovery snapshot. Finalizing
them makes undo of annotation creation retain the newly created annotation.
The native recovery regression checks undo/redo and consecutive snapshots.
Checked MuPDF master on 2026-10-07: it still resets this count unconditionally.

diff --git a/source/pdf/pdf-write.c b/source/pdf/pdf-write.c
--- a/source/pdf/pdf-write.c
+++ b/source/pdf/pdf-write.c
@@ -2871,8 +2871,9 @@ do_pdf_save_document(fz_context *ctx, pdf_document *doc, pdf_write_state *opts, const
 
 		pdf_sync_open_pages(ctx, doc);
 
-		// mark incremental sections as having been saved
-		doc->num_incremental_sections = 0;
+		// A snapshot must leave the live incremental xref available for undo.
+		if (!in_opts->do_snapshot)
+			doc->num_incremental_sections = 0;
 
 		pdf_end_operation(ctx, doc);
 	}
